"SingleCopter with vertically mounted autopilot.  Image courtesy of "
"\"droner\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:12
#: 83e6c98bcc7341ed96ec5f0ef21a1cc9
msgid ""
"Single and Coax copters have one or two propellers to provide thrust and "
"2 to 4 individual flaps to provide roll, pitch and yaw control.  The "
"difference between a SingleCopter and a CoaxCopter is:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:14
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:69
#: 287ff22e3c484d0a8d6b6d48a34a727c 6c73364c50354af1acbbb1493cf86035
msgid "*SingleCopter*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:16
#: c778953a3a094ae3b6c1fd574545bcad
msgid "has a single motor and 4 independent flaps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:17
#: b1e908abbbeb4fd2996bc0e1732c3ffa
msgid ""
"the vehicle's yaw is controlled by adjusting all four fins to point "
"slightly clockwise or counter-clockwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:19
#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:75
#: 292ea325eb744950bfd95a89a71a0995 de332ccb92ac428ea842c8664952977a
msgid "*CoaxCopter*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:21
#: 97b2092e97ba4635bcfb5d37637cd955
msgid ""
"has two counter-rotating motors and at least 2 independent flaps (4 "
"individual servos/flaps can be used but fins on opposite sides of the "
"vehicle will move together)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:22
#: c0a61b325ded4403a04b2ba2bfddc63d
msgid ""
"the vehicle's yaw is controlled by adjusting the speeds of the two "
"motors.  I.e. speeding up the clockwise motor while slowing down the "
"counter-clockwise motor will cause the vehicle to rotate counter-"
"clockwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:25
#: d55930d610e149a1bd1ffdd88a11b19f
msgid "Mounting and Connecting the autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:30
#: 9922022f93b0471285503ec97e61a654
msgid ""
"By default the autopilot should be mounted similar to a \"plus\" quad.  "
"The board should be horizontal with the white arrow pointing towards the "
"forward flap. As with other vehicles the board should be placed close to "
"the center of gravity of the vehicle. If it is more convenient to mount "
"the autopilot pointing up, set :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION <AHRS_ORIENTATION>`"
" to 25 (Pitch270)."
msgstr ""

