"All of the multicopter firmware (quad, hexa, octa, octaquad, y6, tri, "
"single, coax) including single and coax copter have been consolidated "
"into a single firmware. This means the quad (or other multicopter) "
"firmware should be loaded onto the autopilot and then please set:"
msgstr ""

