msgid "Setting up the flaps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:54
#: 14584729b40f4250b4f66394ca0c5517
msgid ""
"The neutral position, direction of movement, minimum and maximum "
"deflection of each flap can be configured with the SERVOx_TRIM, "
"SERVOx_REVERSED, SERVOx_MIN and SERVOx_MAX parameters (where \"x\" is the"
" RC output number).  For example these are the parameters for the forward"
" flap/servo which is connected to RC output 1:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:56
#: f6413729b82d49f6a613719610628cdb
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_MIN <SERVO1_MIN>`: the forward flap/servo's lowest PWM value"
" before it hits its physical limits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:57
#: 05f316316b4e4f5f94c43c861779c5c4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_MAX <SERVO1_MAX>`: the forward flap/servo's highest PWM "
"value before it hits its physical limits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:58
#: 11def063f87847e890b71355abbd9a30
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_TRIM <SERVO1_TRIM>`: the forward flap/servo's PWM value "
"close to what is required to keep the vehicle from spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/singlecopter-and-coaxcopter.rst:59
#: b8d9e72696fb4fd6b71c3a6dab0334aa
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED <SERVO1_REVERSED>`: the forward flap/servo's "
"reverse setting.  0 = servo moves in default direction, 1 to reverse "
"direction of movement."
msgstr ""

